  mac7_d1  #19
  mac7_a1  0.5
  mac8_d1  #18
  mac8_a1  0.15
  # The Reese's two saws through a resonant low pass that LFO 1 opens and
  # closes in eighth triplets, restarting with each note. Lock l1_sync on the
  # steps (1/4, 1/8, 1/8T, 1/16) and the bass talks.
